<title>USA: US 5-yr indexed note auction high yield 3.744 pct.</title>
<headline>US 5-yr indexed note auction high yield 3.744 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said its Dutch bidding auction of 5-year indexed notes produced these results:</p>
<p>			 5-YEAR INDEXED NOTES DUE JULY 15, 2002</p>
<p>			     $8.001 BILLION AUCTION</p>
<p>	     YIELD			  PRICE	COUPON</p>
<p> HIGH	3.744    Awarded At	99.462	3.625</p>
<p> MEDIAN    3.668    High Yield	NOT GIVEN  Percent</p>
<p> LOW	 3.550    63 Percent	NOT GIVEN</p>
<p>	   Cover - (Bids Over Amount Sold)    =  3.31 Times</p>
</text>
